@startuml
title Translate Request Sequence

actor User
participant Client
participant Backend as "TranslatorResource"
participant Service as "GroqTranslationService"
participant Groq

User -> Client: Enter text and click Translate
Client -> Backend: POST /translator/translate (Basic Auth + JSON)
Backend -> Service: translateToDarija(text)
Service -> Groq: Chat Completions API request
Groq --> Service: translated content
Service --> Backend: TranslationOutcome
Backend --> Client: TranslationResponse JSON
Client --> User: Show Darija result

@enduml
